/// @file CMakeLists.txt
/// @brief Configures the Vulkanic renderer, shader compilation, and documentation targets.
///
/// Requires CMake 4.4 or newer. The Windows preset uses Ninja and Clang 20 or
/// newer with `clang-cl`. The Vulkan SDK must provide `glslc` for the Vulkan
/// 1.4 shader target.
///
/// @par Source
/// @verbinclude CMakeLists.txt

/// @file build.ps1
/// @brief Formats, configures, builds, and analyzes the Vulkanic Windows project.
///
/// Requires CMake 4.4 or newer, `clang-format`, and `clang-tidy` on `PATH`. The
/// script automatically uses the only configured preset, `windows`, which
/// requires Ninja, `clang-cl`, and a Vulkan SDK with `glslc`.
/// It formats the top-level `.cpp` files in `src/`, configures when either
/// `build/build.ninja` or `build/compile_commands.json` is missing, builds in
/// parallel, and runs `clang-tidy` on each `.cpp` file using that compilation
/// database.
///
/// @par Source
/// @verbinclude build.ps1
